CAEN FERS Library Readme
    
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

 Content
 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 README				: This file.
 ReleaseNotes		: Revision History and notes.
 src				: source files.
 include			: header files.
 build				: VS project
 bin				: .dll output folder
 lib				: .lib output folder
 FERSlibDemo		: C demo showing how to use the main FERSlib functionalities


 SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS
 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 - Microsoft Windows 10/11
 

 INSTALLATION
 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 - The library is provided as Visual Studio 2019/2022 project. Source code
   is provided too.


